  stableId: quest.cornberg.become-runner
  title: Become Cornberg's Runner
  version: 1
  offer: You've helped with the Slimes, but I keep thinking about that road. I'm not ready to try again yet. Would you take Cornberg's message to the next settlement for me? It's our usual village news. When there's important news to bring back, we count on our runner for that too.
  activeDialogue: Thank you for taking the message. Take care on the road. I hope the trip goes well.
  locationHint: Speak to Cornberg Runner by the village green.
